1
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:04,249
You. Office hands. Show me.

2
00:00:05,150 --> 00:00:07,360
Abby. Come here. Like, right now.

3
00:00:08,150 --> 00:00:12,009
That's a guy in a hoodie. From the
side.

4
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,598
Same ears, though.

5
00:00:14,718 --> 00:00:16,469
Half of Chicago has ears.

6
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:18,773
<i>Don't touch your ear. Don't—</i>

7
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:24,099
Lumen's founder. Eating our fries.

8
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:25,392
<i>…Same ears, though.</i>

9
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:31,684
<i>Thirty-four bucks. Lupe yells for
free.</i>

10
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,582
<i>Nine pans. Never opened one.</i>

11
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:38,713
¡Mija! Look at you! And who's this?
Flaco. Too skinny. Sit.

12
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:43,099
Half my students find me on Groupon
now.

13
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:50,758
Look at these hands. Soft. Office
hands.

14
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,545
Too much masa. It all falls apart.

15
00:00:53,665 --> 00:00:55,252
Sorry— I'll fix it.

16
00:00:55,372 --> 00:00:57,777
Don't fix. Do again.

17
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:01,183
<i>Two hundred jobs. One signature.</i>

18
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:04,919
She's been yelling at me since I was
six.

19
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:08,678
<i>Soft hands. But he looks at her like I
looked at Rogelio.</i>

20
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:13,311
Fold. Tuck. Don't strangle it.

21
00:01:13,900 --> 00:01:17,578
My mom took this class. Before her
stand on 18th.

22
00:01:17,698 --> 00:01:20,285
What made her do it?

23
00:01:20,900 --> 00:01:26,407
Honestly? Broke, bored, and it was
twenty bucks. Fed the whole block for
years off it.

24
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:34,389
I've never made anything. Like… with
my hands.

25
00:01:34,900 --> 00:01:38,632
<i>Her whole world is in this room. And
it's in my bag.</i>

26
00:01:39,900 --> 00:01:42,883
Well. You made this. It's hideous.

27
00:01:43,900 --> 00:01:46,051
It's so hideous.

28
00:01:46,171 --> 00:01:46,970
I love it.

29
00:01:47,650 --> 00:01:50,160
<i>'I love it.' Very chill, Reyes.</i>

30
00:01:50,650 --> 00:01:53,732
Aguas frescas! For everyone. On me.

31
00:01:53,852 --> 00:01:55,693
¡Eso!

32
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:00,108
<i>No. No no no.</i>

33
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:03,179
Fraud desk, calling for Mr. Cole.

34
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:08,601
Mr. Cole, did you authorize thirty-
eight dollars at Masa Mía?

35
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:11,477
…Who's Mr. Cole?
